{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56603","headline":"奉酬裴草然秋晚感见贻之制 · 赵志","name":"奉酬裴草然秋晚感见贻之制","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"景澄旻寓，气从寒葭。\n林惊风叶，菊照霜花。\n爰有吉士，感物兴嗟。\n驰魂岩壑，缔想烟霞。\n展兹逸骥，握此灵虵。\n式存匪石，言降披沙。\n顾慙璧友，空戢瑶华。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"赵志","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56603.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56603","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}